  "content": "<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 750px; margin: auto; font-family: 'Garamond', serif; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #000; padding: 30px;\"><div style=\"border: 2px solid #000; padding: 25px;\"><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"{{school_logo_url}}\" style=\"height: 80px;\"><h1 style=\"margin: 5px 0; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold;\">{{school_name}}</h1><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px;\">{{school_address}}</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 30px;\"><span><strong>Ref No:</strong> ..............</span><span><strong>Date:</strong> {{current_date}}</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px;\">TO WHOM IT MAY CONCERN</h2></div><div style=\"font-size: 18px; line-height: 2; text-align: justify;\"><p style=\"text-indent: 40px;\">This is to certify that <strong>{{student_name}}</strong>, Admission No. <strong>{{admission_no}}</strong>, is a bonafide student of this school. He/She is studying in <strong>Class {{class_section}}</strong> during the academic session <strong>{{academic_session}}</strong>.</p><p style-=\"text-indent: 40px;\">As per our records, his/her date of birth is <strong>{{dob}}</strong>. To the best of our knowledge, he/she bears a good moral character.</p><p style=\"text-indent: 40px;\">This certificate is issued upon the request of the student/parent for his/her personal use.</p></div><div style=\"text-align: right; margin-top: 80px;\"><img src=\"{{student_photo_url}}\" style=\"height: 50px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">(Principal)<br>{{school_name}}</p></div></div></div>",
